{
  "pack": "noir",
  "music": {
    "id": "dark-ambient",
    "volume": 0.09
  },
  "ambience": [
    {
      "sfx": "wind-howling",
      "from": "start",
      "to": "end",
      "volume": 0.12
    },
    {
      "sfx": "fire-crackling",
      "from": "s05",
      "to": "s10",
      "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
      "sfx": "clock-room",
      "from": "s18",
      "to": "s20",
      "volume": 0.16
    }
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "The *paw* / granted three wishes.",
      "template": "type-center",
      "slots": {
        "bigWord": "III"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "Every single one / came ^true.^",
      "template": "type-center",
      "variant": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "It was a dried, _shrivelled_ / monkey's *paw,*",
      "template": "object-hero",
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "a mummified monkey's paw, dried and shrivelled, curled fingers, dark leathery skin",
          "find": [
            "mummified monkey paw",
            "dried monkey hand",
            "mummified hand"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "paw,",
          "id": "s03-object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "brought home by / an old *soldier* from India.",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an old anonymous soldier in a Victorian-era uniform with a white moustache, sepia portrait photograph",
          "find": [
            "unidentified soldier portrait 19th century",
            "old soldier portrait victorian photograph",
            "veteran soldier medals vintage portrait"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "soldier",
          "id": "s04-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "\"Throw it on the *fire,*\" / he warned them.",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "flames burning in an old stone fireplace at night, close",
          "find": [
            "fireplace fire",
            "burning logs fireplace night"
          ],
          "kind": "video",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s05-photo",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.55
          ],
          "zoom": 1.7
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "fire-crackling",
          "at": "fire,",
          "volume": 0.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "\"It gives you / what you ask for…",
      "template": "pinned-note"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "and makes you ^pay.\"^",
      "template": "type-center",
      "variant": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "Mr. White / only *laughed,*",
      "template": "split-panel",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an elderly Victorian gentleman with a white beard smiling, old portrait photograph",
          "find": [
            "victorian old man smiling portrait",
            "elderly gentleman portrait 1890 photograph"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s08-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "and wished for / two hundred *pounds.*",
      "template": "object-hero",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "a small pile of old gold sovereign coins",
          "find": [
            "gold sovereign coins",
            "pile of antique gold coins"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "pounds.",
          "id": "s09-object"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "coin-drop",
          "at": "pounds.",
          "volume": 0.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "The next *morning,*",
      "template": "type-center"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "a *stranger* / came to the door.",
      "template": "figure-spotlight",
      "slots": {
        "figure": {
          "see": "a man in a dark Victorian suit and bowler hat standing full length, formal and grave",
          "find": [
            "victorian man bowler hat full length photograph",
            "edwardian gentleman standing portrait"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "stranger",
          "id": "s11-figure"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "door-open-close",
          "at": "door.",
          "volume": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Their *son* / had been caught",
      "template": "type-center",
      "variant": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "in the *machinery* / at the factory.",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "dark old industrial factory machinery, huge iron gears and belts, 19th century",
          "find": [
            "old factory machinery gears",
            "victorian industrial machine",
            "steam engine gears"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "id": "s13-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "metal-hit",
          "at": "machinery",
          "volume": 0.35
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "The company was / deeply _sorry._",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an old handwritten letter on yellowed paper, early 1900s",
          "find": [
            "old handwritten letter",
            "vintage letter 1900 handwriting"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "company",
          "id": "s14-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "As compensation, / they offered… / *two hundred pounds.*",
      "template": "word-behind",
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "an old British banknote from the early 1900s",
          "find": [
            "old british banknote",
            "antique pound note",
            "vintage british bank note"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "pounds.",
          "id": "s15-object"
        },
        "bigWord": "£200"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "A week later, his wife / shook him *awake.*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "a dark Victorian bedroom at night, an old bed lit by a single candle",
          "find": [
            "victorian bedroom candle night",
            "old bedroom dark candle"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s16-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "\"The *paw.* / Wish our boy _back._\"",
      "template": "type-center",
      "transition": "blur-dissolve"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "He *wished.* / Hours passed.",
      "template": "object-side",
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "an old pendulum wall clock in a dark room",
          "find": [
            "antique pendulum wall clock",
            "old wall clock dark"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "hours",
          "id": "s18-object"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "clock-tick",
          "at": "hours",
          "volume": 0.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Then, at the front door… / a ^knock.^",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an old wooden front door at night seen from inside a dark hallway",
          "find": [
            "old wooden front door night inside",
            "victorian front door dark hallway"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s19-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "knock-door",
          "at": "knock.",
          "volume": 0.9
        },
        {
          "id": "knock-door-01",
          "at": "knock.",
          "offsetMs": 550,
          "volume": 0.75
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "She ran / for the *bolt.*",
      "template": "type-center",
      "transition": "whip-left",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "lock-click",
          "at": "bolt.",
          "volume": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "He dropped to the floor, / found the *paw,*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "a man's hand groping across a dark floor into a strip of light",
          "find": [
            "hand reaching on wooden floor dark",
            "hand reaching in darkness"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s21-floor"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "thud",
          "at": "floor,",
          "volume": 0.35
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "text": "and made the / third *wish.*",
      "template": "type-center",
      "transition": "flash",
      "slots": {
        "bigWord": "3"
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "knock-door-02",
          "at": "made",
          "volume": 0.55
        },
        {
          "id": "sub-drop",
          "at": "wish.",
          "volume": 0.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "text": "The knocking / *stopped.*",
      "template": "type-center",
      "transition": "cut",
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "text": "The road outside / was _empty._",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "transition": "blur-dissolve",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an empty cobbled street at night under a single gas lamp, fog, no people",
          "find": [
            "empty foggy street night lamp",
            "foggy cobblestone street night"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s24-photo"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
